docs {
  # Extract CV Data
  
  This endpoint extracts structured data from a CV/resume PDF file using AI.
  
  ## Requirements
  - Requires authentication (you need to be logged in)
  - File must be a PDF
  - Maximum file size: 10MB
  
  ## Usage
  1. Click on the "cv" field in the body
  2. Select "Choose File" and pick a PDF resume from your computer
  3. Send the request
  
  The response will contain extracted profile data (experience, education, skills, etc.)
  
  ## Note
  This endpoint requires authentication. You'll need to implement login first or
  temporarily disable the auth check for testing.
}
